OL,3,GNEWSAYellow fog warning for Northern
OL,4,AIreland
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yellow weather warning for fog is in
OL,7,Fplace for Northern Ireland, with
OL,8,Fvisibility expected to fall below 100
OL,9,Fmetres in places.
OL,11,FThe warning has been in place since
OL,12,F22:00 GMT on Sunday and will last until
OL,13,F10:00 on Monday, with inland areas
OL,14,Fexpected to be most affected.
OL,16,FFog was expected to develop overnight
OL,17,Fand continue into early Monday,
OL,18,Fbecoming dense in places before
OL,19,Fgradually lifting and clearing during
OL,20,Fthe morning.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
