OL,3,GNEWSAYellow fog warning for Northern
OL,4,AIreland
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn the Republic of Ireland, Met Eireann
OL,7,Fissued a status yellow fog warning for
OL,8,F12 counties from 21:00 (local time) on
OL,9,FSunday until 11:00 on Monday.
